{"id":"4526464ba7e934ba","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-decision-tree.md","title":"Decision Trees and Query Complexity","display":"df-decision-tree — Decision Trees and Query Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-decision-tree","aliases":["28-df-decision-tree"],"display":"df-decision-tree — Decision Trees and Query Complexity","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §12.1 and Definition 12.1","source_printed_pages":"259–260","source_pdf_pages":"285–286","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-decision-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-decision-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-decision-tree — Decision Trees and Query Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §12.1 and Definition 12.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"259–260"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"285–286"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>有限树采用互异标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle0,b\\rangle\">\\(\\langle0,b\\rangle\\)</span>（叶）与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle1,i,t_0,t_1\\rangle\">\\(\\langle1,i,t_0,t_1\\rangle\\)</span>（查询节点）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev},\\operatorname{cost}\">\\(\\operatorname{ev},\\operatorname{cost}\\)</span> 按树结构递归定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DT}\">\\(\\mathrm{DT}\\)</span> 标识本条定义的确定型决策树查询复杂度。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{n,0}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle,\\langle0,1\\rangle\\},\\qquad\\mathcal T_{n,k+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_{n,k}\\cup\\{\\langle1,i,t_0,t_1\\rangle:i\\in[n],\\ t_0,t_1\\in\\mathcal T_{n,k}\\},\\qquad\\mathcal T_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal T_{n,k}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_{n,0}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle,\\langle0,1\\rangle\\},\\qquad\\mathcal T_{n,k+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_{n,k}\\cup\\{\\langle1,i,t_0,t_1\\rangle:i\\in[n],\\ t_0,t_1\\in\\mathcal T_{n,k}\\},\\qquad\\mathcal T_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal T_{n,k}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}(\\langle0,b\\rangle,x)\\coloneqq b,\\qquad\\operatorname{ev}(\\langle1,i,t_0,t_1\\rangle,x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ev}(t_{x_i},x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ev}(\\langle0,b\\rangle,x)\\coloneqq b,\\qquad\\operatorname{ev}(\\langle1,i,t_0,t_1\\rangle,x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ev}(t_{x_i},x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cost}(\\langle0,b\\rangle,x)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\operatorname{cost}(\\langle1,i,t_0,t_1\\rangle,x)\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{cost}(t_{x_i},x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cost}(\\langle0,b\\rangle,x)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\operatorname{cost}(\\langle1,i,t_0,t_1\\rangle,x)\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{cost}(t_{x_i},x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_f\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\mathcal T_n:\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{ev}(t,x)=f(x)\\},\\qquad D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\\coloneqq\\min_{t\\in\\mathcal T_f}\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\operatorname{cost}(t,x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_f\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\mathcal T_n:\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{ev}(t,x)=f(x)\\},\\qquad D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\\coloneqq\\min_{t\\in\\mathcal T_f}\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\operatorname{cost}(t,x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>结构编码保证唯一解析和良基递归。逐位查询的满二叉树计算任意 f，故优化集合非空；n=0 时只有两个常函数，以叶节点计算。成本计查询次数，最优树可删去重复查询。这里使用下标 DT，区别通信模型的 D。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§12.1 and Definition 12.1，印刷页 259–260，PDF 页 285–286。已比对陈述。未声称完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle0,b\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle1,i,t_0,t_1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev},\\operatorname{cost}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_{n,0}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle,\\langle0,1\\rangle\\},\\qquad\\mathcal T_{n,k+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_{n,k}\\cup\\{\\langle1,i,t_0,t_1\\rangle:i\\in[n],\\ t_0,t_1\\in\\mathcal T_{n,k}\\},\\qquad\\mathcal T_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal T_{n,k}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}(\\langle0,b\\rangle,x)\\coloneqq b,\\qquad\\operatorname{ev}(\\langle1,i,t_0,t_1\\rangle,x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ev}(t_{x_i},x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cost}(\\langle0,b\\rangle,x)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\operatorname{cost}(\\langle1,i,t_0,t_1\\rangle,x)\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{cost}(t_{x_i},x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_f\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\mathcal T_n:\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{ev}(t,x)=f(x)\\},\\qquad D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\\coloneqq\\min_{t\\in\\mathcal T_f}\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\operatorname{cost}(t,x).","display":true}],"bytes":2100,"backlinks":[{"id":"4149a72ef2e073f9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathcal T_f,\\operatorname{cost}$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。"},{"id":"8e98636e68215d36","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\deg(f)$ 见 [[28-df-multilinear-degree]]，$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。"},{"id":"bbc032dc63b4bea2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$s(f),bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]；$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-214","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第12章：决策树与证书：[[28-df-decision-tree]]、[[28-df-certificate-complexity]]、[[28-thm-decision-tree-certificate-bound]]。"},{"id":"233f52378190a961","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]；$C(f)$ 见 [[28-df-certificate-complexity]]。"},{"id":"838a6fb712f8a04f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是全定义布尔函数；$d=\\deg(f)$ 见 [[28-df-multilinear-degree]]，$b=bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-block-sensitivity]]，$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}